    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE ULTIMATE SATIRE OF POLITICAL CORRECTNESS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brace yourself for a hilariously offensive experience as you face off against &quot;WOKE&quot; lunatics and their ABSURD ideology.  Unleash complete destruction upon the political correct and &quot;WOKE&quot; corporate oppressor.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096230/extras/7f55b64595f6973363d7a3163a9edd38.avif?t=1754437364\" width=620 height=96 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT GAME :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The plot of &quot;DOGENSTEIN&quot; revolves around a world dominated by a tyrannical oligarch named &quot;Prince&quot; who has ruthlessly eliminated all traditional and &quot;Anti-WOKE&quot; influences. All &quot;Anti-WOKE&quot; people being processed into piles of excrements. Absolute insanity...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096230/extras/002aae1ffdf887dfc8f5b371b3a35c82.poster.avif?t=1754437364\" width=608 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096230/extras/002aae1ffdf887dfc8f5b371b3a35c82.webm?t=1754437364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096230/extras/002aae1ffdf887dfc8f5b371b3a35c82.mp4?t=1754437364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIME HAS COME - IT'S TIME TO FIGHT BACK!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only legendary dog DOGENSTEIN stands against\u00a0oligarch Prince and his &quot;WOKE&quot; puppets! Join DOGENSTEIN in a fast-paced, RETRO FPS like no other.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096230/extras/20651c2a6075e56ecf028028e16d0d2c.avif?t=1754437364\" width=620 height=96 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Destroy &quot;WOKE&quot; lunatics and explode their political correct and &quot;WOKE&quot; Empire.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Play as legendary dog &quot;DOGENSTEIN&quot;.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Old-School Boomer Shooter, inspired by the best 1990s shooters.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Immersive Experience. Discover prisons, &quot;WOKE&quot; cities, factories, and more!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old-School Graphics.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Stunning Retrowave Soundtrack.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Extremely violent and funny dialogs!</strong></p></li></ul>",
